Z||000009||GTMike||09-29-2001||10:54 PM||||well i have been slaveing away all weekend doing first ever fiber glass project other then fixing a hole.   <P>i'm basically making a spacer that goes under the original. i started out with a foam core.  lol  i should have asked some questions  well i made some serious chemical reactions with that.   <P>next was a wood core.  that worked out better.   <P>i now have a fiber glassed 3 inch spacer with a wood core. i'm going to just use it as a spacer for now  if it holds up and i like the hight i will permenently connect the two together with some more fiber glass. i'll take some pix later tonight.  <P>||||reg||1
