Z||000028||Fiero5||10-05-2001||08:40 PM||||Here is an early side shot of Fiero9 showing the one piece stantions better. We both got our stantions thru FOCOA, back when you could usually reach them at least once out of 20 tries  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>They needed a lot of prep work to get the bolts (not included) to fit. The holes were pre-drilled for the bolts, but a few of them were not lined up well. They were solid and the outside finish was very nice. A set costs just around a hundred, so the extra time I spent finishing them off was well worth it. As you can see from the final looks, they came out excellent.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/86_SS_nicesidepassshot_1.jpg"> <P>Steve||||reg||6
